  "caption": "$3.90 per GPU-hour: the median on-demand price of an NVIDIA H100 80GB in our index.\n\nThat is up from $3.49 in late October. H200 ($4.80) and B200 ($6.90) also edged higher, while A100 ($1.75) and MI300X ($2.99) held flat.\n\nA 1-year contract on the H100 is $3.26, about 16% under on-demand. On AMD's MI355X the gap is 39%.\n\nData: Coloprice GPU index, 6 Nov 2026. Sources on the last slide.\n\nAre you seeing the same upward drift in your rental quotes, or is it a mix effect? Tell us below. Full index: link in bio.",
